sub Ensure level transition is displayed to the driver
expect efs: DMI.MasterDMI().Out_LevelTransitionAnnouncement.OutputInformation.DisplayRequested @ deadline=1
expect efs: DMI.MasterDMI().Out_LevelTransitionAnnouncement.Level == LevelEnum.L1 @ deadline=1
step Execute transition to L1, ensure this is no more displayed in the DMI
sub Reach the level transition location
set odo.position 1901.0
sub Level transition executed
expect efs: Kernel.Level.Value.Value == LevelEnum.L1 @ deadline=1
sub Ensure level transition is no more displayed to the driver
expect efs: NOT DMI.MasterDMI().Out_LevelTransitionAnnouncement.OutputInformation.DisplayRequested @ deadline=1
